docs {
  # ExamsService.SuggestStructure

  Courses, questions and weights suggested from each area's weekly hours

  `/ltedu.exams.v1.ExamsService/SuggestStructure` · unary · `ltedu/exams/v1/exams.proto`

  ## Request — `SuggestStructureRequest`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `institution_slug` | `string` |  |
  | `level_ids` | `repeated string` |  |
  | `total_questions` | `int32` |  |

  ## Response — `SuggestStructureResponse`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `courses` | `repeated MockCourse` |  |
  | `weights` | `repeated MockWeight` |  |

  ## Tipos

  ### `MockCourse`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `code` | `string` |  |
  | `name` | `string` |  |
  | `questions` | `int32` |  |

  ### `MockWeight`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `level_id` | `string` |  |
  | `course_code` | `string` |  |
  | `weight` | `double` |  |

  Errores: status gRPC con un `ltedu.common.v1.ErrorDetail` (code, message, fields) en los details.
